    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1231806660
    m_Localized: Welcome to the highway
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1231806661
    m_Localized: 'You bought an abandoned gas station in the middle of the desert. The pumps are broken, the windows are boarded up, there is litter everywhere and hardly any money.


      Your job is to bring the station back to life: clean up, serve passing drivers and invest the money in repairs and new buildings.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1231806662
    m_Localized: How to play
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1231806663
    m_Localized: "Walk with WASD. E (or LMB) is the nearby action: fuel a waiting car, repair a pump, renovate something broken, clean the restroom, pick up litter.\n\nCars queue up on their own. Walk to a pump where a car is waiting and press E. The customer pays and drives off \u2014 or visits the shop."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1231806664
    m_Localized: Money and growth
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1231806665
    m_Localized: "Watch the fuel stock (top right) and order a fuel tanker with O \u2014 it will drive in and unload. Change prices with +/\u2212.\n\nTab \u2014 upgrades, M \u2014 shop goods, H \u2014 hire staff, C \u2014 paint. New buildings are built once you buy their upgrade."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1231806666
    m_Localized: Tasks
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1231806667
    m_Localized: "The current task is at the top of the screen, and the orange arrow \u25BC shows where to go. Tasks lead you from picking up litter to running your own motel.\n\nEsc \u2014 pause and settings, T \u2014 speed up time, J \u2014 achievements."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1231806668
    m_Localized: The laptop and building
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1231806669
    m_Localized: "A laptop stands on the desk by the shop door (E next to it, or N anywhere). It has contract mail, the bank, staff, suppliers, owner skills, events and your collection \u2014 all with the mouse.\n\nB \u2014 build mode: trash bins, benches, lamps, cameras and more, each one useful.\n\nK \u2014 regulars, F \u2014 finances, F12 \u2014 photo mode. Good luck!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1231806670
    m_Localized: Best gas station on the highway!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1231806671
    m_Localized: Fast, clean, friendly. I'll be back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1231806672
    m_Localized: Five stars, great coffee too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1231806673
    m_Localized: Nice place, hardly any queue.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1231806674
    m_Localized: All good, fair prices.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1231806675
    m_Localized: A pleasant stop on the road.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1231806676
    m_Localized: Okay, but could be better.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1231806677
    m_Localized: Had to wait a bit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1231806678
    m_Localized: Prices bite.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1231806679
    m_Localized: Slow and a bit dirty.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1231806680
    m_Localized: Expensive for a place like this.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
