  - m_Id: 1231806752
    m_Localized: "WASD / arrows \u2014 walk\nE / LMB \u2014 nearby action: fuel a car, change tires, repair a pump, clean the restroom or a motel room, pick up litter\n\n1 / 2 / 3 \u2014 select fuel   + / \u2212 \u2014 price   O \u2014 order 500 L\nTab \u2014 upgrades (flip through the pages)   M \u2014 shop   C \u2014 paint   H \u2014 staff   J \u2014 achievements   K \u2014 regulars   F \u2014 finances, bank, competitor\nThe laptop by the shop door (E next to it or N anywhere): contract mail, bank, competitor, regulars, statistics \u2014 all with the mouse\nB \u2014 build mode: WASD \u2014 camera, wheel \u2014 zoom, 1\u20138 \u2014 object, Q / E \u2014 rotate, LMB \u2014 place, RMB \u2014 remove\nF12 \u2014 photo mode: free camera, Space \u2014 screenshot\n\nT \u2014 game speed \xD71 / \xD72 / \xD73   R \u2014 radio   F1 \u2014 hints   L \u2014 language\nF5 \u2014 save   F9 \u2014 load   Esc \u2014 pause"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
